# Build context = repository root (see nim_advisor/Dockerfile). Allowlist: only what the image needs,
# so .env, .git, db_export/ and local working files never reach the build.
*
!nim_advisor/requirements.txt
!nim_advisor/app/
!nim_advisor/certs/
!nim_profile_finder_v2.sh
!nim_catalog.json
!nims_catalog/
!reference/
nims_catalog/_logs/
reference/research/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc